wco:CV_TransactionNatureTypeCode_1   a skos:Concept;   skos:inScheme wco:CL_TransactionNatureTypeCode;   skos:notation "1";   skos:prefLabel "1"@en;   skos:definition "Transactions involving actual or intended transfer of ownership from residents to non-residents against financial or other compensation (except the transactions listed under 2, 7, 8)"@en .

wco:CV_TransactionNatureTypeCode_2   a skos:Concept;   skos:inScheme wco:CL_TransactionNatureTypeCode;   skos:notation "2";   skos:prefLabel "2"@en;   skos:definition "Return and replacement of goods free of charge after registration of the original transaction"@en .

wco:CV_TransactionNatureTypeCode_3   a skos:Concept;   skos:inScheme wco:CL_TransactionNatureTypeCode;   skos:notation "3";   skos:prefLabel "3"@en;   skos:definition "Transactions involving transfer of ownership without financial or in-kind compensation (e.g. aid shipments)"@en .

wco:CV_TransactionNatureTypeCode_4   a skos:Concept;   skos:inScheme wco:CL_TransactionNatureTypeCode;   skos:notation "4";   skos:prefLabel "4"@en;   skos:definition "Operations with a view to processing (2) under contract (no transfer of ownership to the processor)"@en .

wco:CV_TransactionNatureTypeCode_5   a skos:Concept;   skos:inScheme wco:CL_TransactionNatureTypeCode;   skos:notation "5";   skos:prefLabel "5"@en;   skos:definition "Operations following processing under contract (no transfer of ownership to the processor)"@en .

wco:CV_TransactionNatureTypeCode_6   a skos:Concept;   skos:inScheme wco:CL_TransactionNatureTypeCode;   skos:notation "6";   skos:prefLabel "6"@en;   skos:definition "Particular transactions recorded for national purposes"@en .

wco:CV_TransactionNatureTypeCode_7   a skos:Concept;   skos:inScheme wco:CL_TransactionNatureTypeCode;   skos:notation "7";   skos:prefLabel "7"@en;   skos:definition "Operations under joint defence projects or other joint intergovernmental production programmes"@en .

wco:CV_TransactionNatureTypeCode_8   a skos:Concept;   skos:inScheme wco:CL_TransactionNatureTypeCode;   skos:notation "8";   skos:prefLabel "8"@en;   skos:definition "Transactions involving the supply of building materials and technical equipment under a general construction or civil engineering contract for which no separate invoicing of the goods is required and an invoice for the total contract is issued"@en .

